 ( { In the game Carlsen, M - Bortnyk, O (2023) the World #1 played } 1. Rh2 $2 { , missing a crushing blow. Can you spot the move that Magnus missed? } ) 
1. { -KEY- } Nf4 $1 { A devastating discovered attack. } exf4 2. Rxd7+ $18 { White breaks into the seventh rank, with an easily winning position. From here, he could perhaps follow up with 34.Rh7 next and then 35.Rdd7, in order to double up rooks on the seventh rank. } 
